OL,3,GNEWSAWhen did grey squirrels start
OL,4,Aposing a threat to reds?
OL,5,
OL,6,FEndangered red squirrel populations
OL,7,Fhave plummeted from about 3.5 million
OL,8,Fto less than 300,000 in the UK, with
OL,9,Ftheir grey-haired rivals continuing to
OL,10,Fthrive.
OL,12,FBut when exactly did the squirrel
OL,13,Fstand-off begin and how bad has the
OL,14,Fsituation become?
OL,16,FIn England, the situation is
OL,17,Fparticularly dire for reds.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
