OL,3,GNEWSAWhen did grey squirrels start
OL,4,Aposing a threat to reds?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Woodland Trust reckons there are
OL,7,Fonly 39,000 of them left, while the
OL,8,FSave Our Reds campaign thinks just
OL,9,F15,000 remain, including in
OL,10,Fconservation areas such as Formby on
OL,11,FMerseyside.
